html=r'''<!doctype html><html lang="en" data-release="1.7-review" data-visual-system="photo-twin-natural-border"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light"><meta name="description" content="Manzanita Works visual convergence review: real public photographs, Photo Twin normalization, natural-border treatments, actor-specific place apertures, and assistance-first stewardship."><title>Manzanita Works · Real Place Fabric Review</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"><script src="assets/place-data.js"></script><script src="app.js" defer></script></head><body><a class="skip" href="#fabric">Skip to place fabric</a><header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="#fabric"><span class="mark">⌁</span><span><b>MANZANITA WORKS</b><small>REAL PLACE FABRIC · REVIEW</small></span></a><nav aria-label="Primary"><a href="#fabric">PLACE</a><a href="#controls">CONDITIONS</a><a href="#assistance">ASSISTANCE</a><a href="#evidence">EVIDENCE</a><a href="#handoff">HANDOFF</a></nav><button id="themeBtn" class="utility" type="button">LIGHT</button></header><main><section class="hero" id="fabric"><div class="stage" id="stage"><img id="sceneImage" src="assets/lida-twin.webp" alt="Public-source Pasadena landscape used as a bounded demonstration place"><div class="photo-veil"></div><svg class="overlay" id="overlay" viewBox="0 0 1000 750" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"></svg><div class="stage-top"><span id="evidenceClass">PHOTO TWIN · PUBLIC SOURCE</span><span id="sourceLabel">PASADENA DEMONSTRATION CORRIDOR</span></div><div class="hero-copy"><p class="kicker">ONE LIVING PLACE · MANY BOUNDED VIEWS</p><h1>A place earns attention when it returns something.</h1><p id="sceneReading">A lived place contains shade, paths, pets, play, labor, water, access, and routines that a parcel score cannot represent.</p></div><aside class="scene-card"><span id="sceneEyebrow">HOUSEHOLD APERTURE</span><h2 id="sceneTitle">Household habitat</h2><p id="sceneAction">Protect useful shade and lived circulation first.</p><small id="sceneAuthority">Resident / steward · observed public photograph, illustrative analysis</small></aside><div class="legend" id="legend"></div></div><div class="aperture-rail" role="tablist" aria-label="Place apertures" id="apertureRail"></div></section>
<section class="control-deck" id="controls"><article class="control-panel"><header><span>EIGHT INDEPENDENT CONDITIONS</span><h2>Reveal a condition without turning it into a verdict.</h2><p>The public treatment follows visible composition lines. Unsupported edges remain open. Selecting a layer changes the question, not the resident's standing.</p></header><div class="chip-grid" id="conditionRail"></div><div class="condition-readout"><b id="conditionTitle">NO CONDITION SELECTED</b><p id="conditionReading">Choose one or several bounded evidence layers.</p></div></article><article class="control-panel"><header><span>FIVE OPERATING SEATS</span><h2>Give each actor the minimum aperture required for the work.</h2><p>Seat changes alter the operative question, next safe action, acceptance condition, and handoff. The underlying place identity remains the same.</p></header><div class="seat-rail" id="seatRail"></div><p class="seat-question" id="seatQuestion"></p><div class="seat-readout"><dl><div><dt>NEXT ACTION</dt><dd id="seatAction"></dd></div><div><dt>ACCEPT WHEN</dt><dd id="seatAcceptance"></dd></div><div><dt>HANDOFF</dt><dd id="seatHandoff"></dd></div></dl></div></article></section>
<section class="return-grid" aria-labelledby="returns-title"><div class="section-head"><span>HOUSEHOLD HABITAT</span><h2 id="returns-title">Keep the reasons people care about the place.</h2><p>Manzanita starts with ordinary use and visible burden, then widens only when a larger aperture is necessary.</p></div><div class="cards"><article><b>SHADE</b><h3>Keep the useful canopy.</h3><p>Cooling, play, comfort, habitat, and street continuity are operating value, not decorative residue.</p></article><article><b>WATER</b><h3>Make flow legible.</h3><p>Capture, infiltration, irrigation, and runoff become bounded evidence instead of a generic sustainability score.</p></article><article><b>USE</b><h3>Give the household a reason to return.</h3><p>Food, pets, play, clipping, harvesting, repair, observation, and ordinary rituals create durable attention.</p></article><article><b>FIRE</b><h3>Route help before punishment.</h3><p>Wildfire context prioritizes horticultural remediation, access, fuel work, and verification. It is purpose-limited against automatic insurance denial.</p></article></div></section>
<section id="assistance" class="assistance"><div><span>ASSISTANCE-FIRST OPERATION</span><h2>Risk context should start help.</h2><p>Regional conditions and verified local evidence become a bounded offer of ordinary horticulture, tools, labor, access work, follow-through, and verification.</p></div><ol><li><b>01</b><span>Observe and preserve useful assets.</span></li><li><b>02</b><span>Name the supported boundary and uncertainty.</span></li><li><b>03</b><span>Offer the smallest useful remediation.</span></li><li><b>04</b><span>Verify work and recurring burden.</span></li><li><b>05</b><span>Escalate only when evidence and authority support it.</span></li></ol></section>
<section id="evidence" class="evidence"><div class="section-head"><span>SOURCE AND CLAIM LEDGER</span><h2>Pictures do not get to outrank their receipts.</h2><p>The five source photographs are retained public-source demonstrations. Photo Twin changes tone only. Region and stewardship views are explicitly derived compositions rather than observations.</p></div><div class="evidence-grid"><article><h3>PHOTO TWIN</h3><p>Pixel geometry is preserved while contrast, glare, color, and warmth are normalized for legibility.</p></article><article><h3>NATURAL BORDER</h3><p>Rails follow visually recognizable curb, walk, driveway, bed, hedge, canopy, and open-surface relationships. They stay open where support is absent.</p></article><article><h3>CLAIM BOUNDARY</h3><p>No photograph proves ownership, consent, species identity, treatment history, insurance risk, or resident quality.</p></article><article><h3>PURPOSE FIREWALL</h3><p>Wildfire and environmental context may route assistance and verification. It may not become automatic insurance denial, unrelated property scoring, or resident ranking.</p></article></div><details><summary>OPEN SOURCE LEDGER</summary><div class="source-ledger" id="sourceLedger"></div></details></section>
<section id="handoff" class="handoff"><div><span>ESSENTIAL ATTENTION HANDOFF</span><h2>Carry the place forward without laundering uncertainty.</h2><p>The successor receives the selected aperture, operating seat, active conditions, source identities, next action, acceptance condition, and unresolved limits. No external effect is executed from this public review object.</p></div><button id="exportBtn" type="button">EXPORT LOCAL HANDOFF JSON</button></section></main><footer><span>MANZANITA WORKS · VISUAL CONVERGENCE REVIEW 1.7</span><span>REVIEW ONLY · PUBLIC RELEASE EFFECT: NONE</span></footer></body></html>'''

css=r''':root{--bg:#11150f;--paper:#f0ebdd;--ink:#151713;--muted:#6b6a61;--rule:rgba(239,234,220,.22);--accent:#ff5b32;--green:#7da164;--paper2:#ded8ca;--dark:#11150f;--sans:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;--mono:"IBM Plex Mono",ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;background:var(--bg)}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#eee9dd;font-family:var(--sans)}button,a{font:inherit}.skip{position:fixed;left:-999px;top:10px;z-index:99;background:#fff;color:#111;padding:12px}.skip:focus{left:10px}.topbar{height:64px;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 22px;background:rgba(15,19,14,.94);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.brand{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;color:#f7f1e4;text-decoration:none}.brand .mark{color:var(--accent);font-size:24px}.brand span:last-child{display:grid;gap:2px}.brand b{font:800 13px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em}.brand small{font:600 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#a9aa9d}.topbar nav{display:flex;gap:28px}.topbar nav a,.utility{font:700 9px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#e8e3d7;text-decoration:none}.utility{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:10px 14px}.hero{border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.stage{position:relative;min-height:calc(100vh - 126px);overflow:hidden;background:#151915}.stage>img{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.photo-veil{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(8,11,8,.10) 0%,rgba(8,11,8,.02) 45%,rgba(8,11,8,.25) 78%,rgba(8,11,8,.56) 100%),linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(8,11,8,.64) 0%,rgba(8,11,8,.02) 45%)}.overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;pointer-events:none}.overlay path{vector-effect:non-scaling-stroke}.stage-top{position:absolute;left:22px;right:22px;top:18px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;color:#f4efe3;font:700 9px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.11em;text-shadow:0 1px 8px #000}.hero-copy{position:absolute;left:clamp(22px,4vw,68px);bottom:clamp(62px,10vh,112px);max-width:min(720px,65vw);text-shadow:0 2px 28px rgba(0,0,0,.78)}.kicker,.section-head>span,.control-panel header>span,.assistance>div>span,.handoff>div>span{display:block;margin:0 0 12px;color:#ff7a55;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.15em}.hero h1{margin:0;max-width:700px;font-size:clamp(38px,5.3vw,78px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:820}.hero-copy>p:last-child{max-width:650px;margin:18px 0 0;font-size:clamp(16px,1.45vw,21px);line-height:1.5;color:#e7e2d6}.scene-card{position:absolute;right:clamp(18px,3.5vw,56px);top:clamp(72px,12vh,125px);width:min(345px,28vw);padding:20px;background:rgba(14,18,13,.80);backdrop-filter:blur(15px);border:1px solid rgba(245,240,227,.34);box-shadow:0 22px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.28)}.scene-card>span{font:800 9px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.14em;color:#ff7a55}.scene-card h2{font-size:27px;line-height:1;margin:10px 0 12px}.scene-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#e2ddd1}.scene-card small{display:block;margin-top:14px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font:600 9px/1.5 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.05em;color:#bcbbae}.legend{position:absolute;left:22px;bottom:20px;display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.legend span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;padding:7px 9px;background:rgba(14,18,13,.82);border:1px solid var(--rule);font:700 8px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em}.legend i{width:17px;height:3px;display:inline-block}.aperture-rail{min-height:62px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(7,1fr);background:#10130f;border-top:1px solid var(--rule)}.aperture-rail button{min-height:62px;border:0;border-right:1px solid var(--rule);background:transparent;color:#c8c5b9;text-align:left;padding:11px 13px;font:700 9px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.08em}.aperture-rail button small{display:block;margin-bottom:6px;color:#6f7469}.aperture-rail button[aria-selected=true]{background:#f0ebdd;color:#141611}.aperture-rail button[aria-selected=true] small{color:var(--accent)}.control-deck{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.18fr .82fr;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink)}.control-panel{padding:clamp(30px,4vw,64px);border-bottom:1px solid #bbb5a6}.control-panel+.control-panel{border-left:1px solid #bbb5a6}.control-panel h2,.section-head h2,.assistance h2,.handoff h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0}.control-panel header p,.section-head p,.assistance p,.handoff p{color:#5e5d55;font-size:17px;line-height:1.5;max-width:760px}.chip-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid #aaa496;border-left:1px solid #aaa496;margin-top:30px}.chip-grid button{min-height:72px;border:0;border-right:1px solid #aaa496;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa496;background:transparent;color:#262821;font:800 9px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em}.chip-grid button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#181b16;color:#f3eddf;box-shadow:inset 0 -4px var(--chip)}.condition-readout{margin-top:20px;min-height:58px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:140px 1fr;gap:18px}.condition-readout b{font:800 11px/1.2 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em}.condition-readout p{margin:0;color:#5f5f57;line-height:1.45}.seat-rail{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:28px 0}.seat-rail button{border:1px solid #948f82;background:transparent;padding:10px 12px;font:800 9px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.06em;min-height:44px}.seat-rail button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#151713;color:#f5efe2;border-color:#151713}.seat-question{font-size:21px;line-height:1.35;font-weight:700;margin:0 0 20px}.seat-readout dl{display:grid;gap:0;margin:0;border-top:1px solid #aaa496}.seat-readout dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:16px;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa496}.seat-readout dt{font:800 9px/1.4 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.11em;color:#78766c}.seat-readout dd{margin:0;line-height:1.45}.return-grid{background:#151913;padding:clamp(44px,6vw,92px) clamp(22px,5vw,78px)}.section-head{max-width:900px;margin-bottom:40px}.section-head h2{max-width:780px}.section-head p{color:#aaa99e}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}.cards article{min-height:270px;padding:26px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.cards b{font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:#ff7a55}.cards h3{font-size:25px;line-height:1.05;margin:54px 0 12px}.cards p{color:#aaa99e;line-height:1.5}.assistance{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:60px;padding:clamp(44px,6vw,88px) clamp(22px,5vw,78px);background:#ff5b32;color:#151713}.assistance>div>span{color:#151713}.assistance p{color:#362b24}.assistance ol{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);border-left:1px solid rgba(20,20,15,.45);border-top:1px solid rgba(20,20,15,.45)}.assistance li{min-height:190px;padding:16px;border-right:1px solid rgba(20,20,15,.45);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(20,20,15,.45);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between}.assistance li b{font:800 28px/1 var(--mono)}.assistance li span{font-weight:750;line-height:1.1}.evidence{padding:clamp(44px,6vw,92px) clamp(22px,5vw,78px);background:#0e120e}.evidence-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}.evidence-grid article{padding:24px;min-height:210px;border-right:1px solid var(--rule);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule)}.evidence-grid h3{color:#ff7a55}.evidence-grid p{color:#a9aa9e;line-height:1.5}.evidence details{margin-top:28px;border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:18px}.evidence summary{cursor:pointer;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em}.source-ledger{margin-top:18px;display:grid;gap:10px}.source-ledger article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .7fr .7fr 1.4fr;gap:12px;padding:12px;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font-size:12px}.source-ledger a{color:#9ccce3}.handoff{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;align-items:end;gap:40px;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);padding:clamp(44px,6vw,88px) clamp(22px,5vw,78px)}.handoff button{background:#151713;color:#f1ebde;border:0;padding:16px 20px;font:800 10px/1 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.09em;min-height:44px}.handoff button:hover{background:#ff5b32;color:#151713}footer{min-height:70px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:20px 24px;background:#0b0e0b;border-top:1px solid var(--rule);font:700 8px/1.4 var(--mono);letter-spacing:.1em;color:#9b9c91}@media(max-width:1000px){.topbar nav{display:none}.control-deck,.assistance{grid-template-columns:1fr}.control-panel+.control-panel{border-left:0}.cards,.evidence-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.scene-card{width:min(330px,38vw)}.handoff{grid-template-columns:1fr}.aperture-rail button{min-height:66px}}@media(max-width:640px){.topbar{padding:0 12px;height:58px}.brand small{display:none}.stage{min-height:720px}.stage-top{left:14px;right:14px;top:12px}.stage-top span:last-child{display:none}.hero-copy{left:16px;right:16px;bottom:170px;max-width:none}.hero h1{font-size:46px;max-width:500px}.hero-copy>p:last-child{font-size:15px}.scene-card{left:16px;right:16px;top:auto;bottom:20px;width:auto;padding:14px}.scene-card h2{font-size:20px;margin:7px 0}.scene-card p{font-size:12px;margin:0}.scene-card small{font-size:8px;margin-top:8px;padding-top:7px}.legend{display:none}.aperture-rail{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory}.aperture-rail button{flex:0 0 132px;scroll-snap-align:start}.control-panel{padding:34px 18px}.chip-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.condition-readout{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cards,.evidence-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cards article{min-height:210px}.assistance,.evidence,.return-grid,.handoff{padding:42px 18px}.assistance ol{grid-template-columns:1fr}.assistance li{min-height:90px}.source-ledger article{grid-template-columns:1fr}.handoff button{width:100%}footer{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto!important;transition:none!important}}body.light .topbar{background:rgba(238,233,220,.95)}body.light .brand,body.light .topbar nav a,body.light .utility{color:#141611}body.light .stage{filter:saturate(.96)}@media print{.topbar,.aperture-rail,.control-deck,.return-grid,.assistance,.handoff,footer{display:none!important}.stage{min-height:7.2in}.scene-card{background:#fff;color:#111}.scene-card p,.scene-card small{color:#333}.photo-veil{background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.35),transparent 55%)}}'''

js=r'''(()=>{const D=window.MANZANITA_PLACE_DATA;const $=s=>document.querySelector(s);const $$=s=>[...document.querySelectorAll(s)];let aperture='household',seat='resident',active=new Set();const q=new URLSearchParams(location.search);if(D.scenes[q.get('aperture')])aperture=q.get('aperture');if(D.seats[q.get('seat')])seat=q.get('seat');for(const c of (q.get('conditions')||'').split(','))if(D.conditions[c])active.add(c);function url(){const u=new URL(location.href);u.searchParams.set('aperture',aperture);u.searchParams.set('seat',seat);active.size?u.searchParams.set('conditions',[...active].join(',')):u.searchParams.delete('conditions');history.replaceState(null,'',u)}function build(){const ar=$('#apertureRail');Object.entries(D.scenes).forEach(([k,v],i)=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.dataset.aperture=k;b.setAttribute('role','tab');b.innerHTML=`<small>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</small>${v.title.toUpperCase()}`;b.onclick=()=>{aperture=k;draw();url()};ar.appendChild(b)});const cr=$('#conditionRail');Object.entries(D.conditions).forEach(([k,v])=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.dataset.condition=k;b.style.setProperty('--chip',v.color);b.textContent=v.label.toUpperCase();b.onclick=()=>{active.has(k)?active.delete(k):active.add(k);draw();url()};cr.appendChild(b)});const sr=$('#seatRail');Object.entries(D.seats).forEach(([k,v])=>{const b=document.createElement('button');b.type='button';b.dataset.seat=k;b.textContent=v.label.toUpperCase();b.onclick=()=>{seat=k;draw();url()};sr.appendChild(b)});const led=$('#sourceLedger');Object.entries(D.sources).filter(([k])=>!['context','continuity'].includes(k)).forEach(([k,v])=>{const a=document.createElement('article');a.innerHTML=`<b>${v.label}</b><span>${v.author}</span><span>${v.license}</span><a href="${v.page}" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank">SOURCE PAGE ↗</a>`;led.appendChild(a)});$('#themeBtn').onclick=()=>{document.body.classList.toggle('light');$('#themeBtn').textContent=document.body.classList.contains('light')?'DARK':'LIGHT'};$('#exportBtn').onclick=exportState;draw()}function draw(){const s=D.scenes[aperture];$('#sceneImage').src=s.asset;$('#sceneImage').alt=`${s.title}: public-source or explicitly derived demonstration image`;$('#sceneEyebrow').textContent=s.eyebrow.toUpperCase();$('#sceneTitle').textContent=s.title;$('#sceneReading').textContent=s.reading;$('#sceneAction').textContent=s.action;$('#sceneAuthority').textContent=s.authority;$('#evidenceClass').textContent=s.class.toUpperCase();$('#sourceLabel').textContent=(D.sources[s.source]?.label||s.source).toUpperCase();$$('#apertureRail button').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-selected',b.dataset.aperture===aperture?'true':'false'));$$('#conditionRail button').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',active.has(b.dataset.condition)?'true':'false'));$$('#seatRail button').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',b.dataset.seat===seat?'true':'false'));const S=D.seats[seat];$('#seatQuestion').textContent=S.question;$('#seatAction').textContent=S.action;$('#seatAcceptance').textContent=S.acceptance;$('#seatHandoff').textContent=S.handoff;const last=[...active].at(-1);$('#conditionTitle').textContent=last?D.conditions[last].label.toUpperCase():'NO CONDITION SELECTED';$('#conditionReading').textContent=last?D.conditions[last].reading:'Choose one or several bounded evidence layers.';const svg=$('#overlay');svg.replaceChildren();active.forEach(k=>(D.paths[aperture][k]||[]).forEach(path=>{const p=document.createElementNS('http://www.w3.org/2000/svg','path');p.setAttribute('d',path);p.setAttribute('fill','none');p.setAttribute('stroke',D.conditions[k].color);p.setAttribute('stroke-width',k==='authority'?'2.2':'3.4');p.setAttribute('stroke-linecap','round');p.setAttribute('stroke-linejoin','round');p.setAttribute('opacity',k==='authority'?'.86':'.92');svg.appendChild(p)}));const leg=$('#legend');leg.replaceChildren();active.forEach(k=>{const sp=document.createElement('span');sp.innerHTML=`<i style="background:${D.conditions[k].color}"></i>${D.conditions[k].label.toUpperCase()}`;leg.appendChild(sp)})}function exportState(){const s=D.scenes[aperture],S=D.seats[seat];const payload={schema:'manzanita-works/public-handoff@1',release:D.release,aperture,seat,conditions:[...active],source:s.source,evidence_class:s.class,next_action:S.action,acceptance:S.acceptance,handoff:S.handoff,authority:s.authority,effects:'none'};const blob=new Blob([JSON.stringify(payload,null,2)+'\n'],{type:'application/json'});const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=URL.createObjectURL(blob);a.download='manzanita-public-handoff.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href),1000)}document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',build)})();'''

(OUT/'index.html').write_text(html,encoding='utf-8')
(OUT/'style.css').write_text(css,encoding='utf-8')
(OUT/'app.js').write_text(js,encoding='utf-8')

license_text='''# Visual asset licenses\n\nThis review build uses five Pasadena street-facing photographs by TheCatalyst31 from Wikimedia Commons. Michigan Avenue views 01–04 are CC BY-SA 3.0. The 1360 Lida Street photograph is CC0 1.0.\n\nThe `*-twin.webp` files are photometric derivatives. Geometry is not warped or regenerated. The CC BY-SA derivatives remain under CC BY-SA 3.0 and preserve attribution in `assets/source-ledger.json`. The Lida derivative may be reused under CC0. Region and stewardship boards are compositions; each constituent image retains its source license.\n'''
(OUT/'LICENSE_VISUAL_ASSETS.md').write_text(license_text,encoding='utf-8')
readme='''# Manzanita Works v1.7 visual convergence review\n\nThis is a **review-only** candidate. It deliberately does not modify the public `/manzanita/` route. It reconnects the current Manzanita interaction model to the real-photo Street Glide visual lineage: Photo Twin, Natural Border Snap, open Landscape Surface grammar, seven place apertures, eight independent conditions, five operating seats, assistance-first remediation, and bounded successor handoff.\n\nGenerated and modeled imagery is never presented as observation. Michigan Avenue and Lida Street source photographs are public Wikimedia Commons demonstration assets with attribution and rights retained in the source ledger.\n'''
(OUT/'README.md').write_text(readme,encoding='utf-8')

files={}
for p in sorted(x for x in OUT.rglob('*') if x.is_file() and x.name!='BUILD_RECEIPT.json'):
    files[p.relative_to(OUT).as_posix()]={'bytes':p.stat().st_size,'sha256':hashlib.sha256(p.read_bytes()).hexdigest()}
receipt={'schema':'manzanita-works/real-place-review-build@1','release':'1.7-review','result':'BUILT_FOR_VISUAL_REVIEW','classification':'review_only_no_public_effect','files':files,'source_count':5,'photo_twin_count':5,'aperture_count':7,'condition_count':8,'seat_count':5,'authority':place_data['authority']}
(OUT/'BUILD_RECEIPT.json').write_text(json.dumps(receipt,indent=2)+'\n',encoding='utf-8')
print(json.dumps({'result':'BUILT','route':str(OUT),'files':len(files),'sources':5},indent=2))
